                    <p>tataḥ sādhako mahāṭavyādimano'nukūlapradeśe pūrvobhimukhaḥ sattvaparyaṅkeṇopaviśya sarvasattveṣu mahākaruṇācittamutpādya svaparahitahetorvakṣyamāṇakrameṇa vajrasattvapadaṁ sādhayet|</p>
