                <div class="bg-white/70 p-4 text-lg leading-relaxed text-sky-900 space-y-2" style="font-family: 'Noto Serif Tibetan', 'Microsoft Himalaya', serif;">
                    <p>de ltar rten gyi dkyil 'khor bskyed nas b+h+rU~M las gzhal yas khang pa ste |</p>
                    <p>gru bzhi pa la sgo bzhi pa |</p>
                    <p>rta babs bzhi yis rab brgyan nas |</p>
                    <p>thig le bzhi dang yang dag ldan |</p>
                    <p>ka ba brgyad kyis nyer brgyan pa |</p>
